<title>USA: Johnson named chairman of KinderCare.</title>
<headline>Johnson named chairman of KinderCare.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>KinderCare Learning Centers Inc and KCLC Acquisition Corp said David Johnson will succeed Sandra Scarr as chairman on the closing of the acquisition by KCLC, which is expected to be in early 1997.</p>
<p>KCLC is an affiliate of Kohlberg, Kravis, Roberts &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Scarr, who announced her intention to retire upon the closing of the acquisition, will continue at Kindercare as a member of the board. Johnson was most recently chairman and chief executive of Red Lion Hotels Inc.</p>
<p>The closing of the acquisition of KinderCare remains subject to the satisfaction of a number of conditions.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
